Package: dseams
Type: Package
Title: Ice Classification and Ring Statistics for Molecular Simulations
Version: 2.14.0
Authors@R: person("Rohit", "Goswami", email = "rgoswami@ieee.org",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2393-6242"))
Description: S3 bindings to the d-SEAMS engine. Frames come back as
    data.frames for ice-type labels, primitive-ring censuses, and
    bond-orientational order parameters. The classifiers are libyodaLib;
    this package does not reimplement them.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
LinkingTo: cpp11
SystemRequirements: libseams_lang and libyodaLib from a seams-core build
    (pkg-config seams-lang, or SEAMS_LIBDIR and SEAMS_INCLUDE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://docs.dseams.info
BugReports: https://github.com/d-SEAMS/seams-core/issues
